            and each entry preserves  attribution so a reviewer
            can answer "which sidecar or probe supplied this fact?" without inspecting logs.

Ordinals are pinned explicitly so the wire format is stable across versions
            and external clients. New members MUST be appended with the next unused ordinal;
            existing members MUST NOT be reordered or renumbered.
